// with the HIGHEST ratio first; troops with exactly the same ratio: the smaller squad bonus first - army and monsters together, every monster tier in the same list
// (a higher tier never dies before a lower one only because of its tier).
// The places Kn+1 (K = 3, 4, 6, 8: 4, 7, 10 ... / 5, 9, 13 ... / 7, 13 ... / 9, 17 ...) are exempt from the strength rule (they only follow the health of the stack before them), so they take the OUTLIERS - the ratio levels
// that would otherwise force a big drop in health.
