// the smaller squad bonus dies first. The engineers (higher tier first) stand in front of everything.
// The ORDER OF THE GROUPS (lowest ratio first is tried first, then highest first, then all the others) and - for a small group - whether it stands on the places Kn+1
// (exempt from the strength rule) at the place that suits its squad bonus, is the one that gives the most damage.
