  // 19.0.20: the spread: every strike of a stack is its own roll (the Double damage chance (class + army, one roll), the monsters' Double strike and the army Double strike are independent): the damage of a strike is its average x F/mean(F), F = the product of (1 + a 0/1 roll) per source. The strikes are independent: the variances add up.
